    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIR\nCALIFORNIA\nTIMETABLE\nEffective October 1, 1978\nNew: Statewide Service to Fresno\nSERVING FRESNO, LAKE TAHOE, MONTEREY/SALINAS,\nOAKLAND, ONTARIO, ORANGE COUNTY, PALM SPRINGS,\nSACRAMENTO, SAN DIEGO, SAN FRANCISCO AND SAN JOSE.",
      "Fresno.\nNow Air California\nmakes it easy.\nStatewide service and the lowest fares to Central California's\ngateway city.\nFresno is the gateway to agriculture, business and recreation\nin Central California. And now only Air California can jet you\nnonstop between Fresno and Oakland, Ontario, Orange\nCounty, San Jose and Lake Tahoe, with convenient\nconnecting service between\nSan Diego, Sacramento and\nPalm Springs.\nFlying Air California to\nFresno is quick and\neconomical, with regularly\nscheduled morning and\nevening flights.\nAir California makes flying\nto Fresno easy, with\ncomputerized reservations\nand ticketing and the\nlowest fares.\nSo plan to take off for\nFresno on Air California.\nAnd make it easy on yourself.\nFRESNO TO\nLAKE TAHOE\nFlight\n7\n7\n7\n7\nFare\nLeave Arrive Basis\nMonday thru Thursday\n9:05A\n9:40A\nS\nFriday\n9:05A\n9:40A\nS\nSaturday\n9:05A\n9:40A\nS\nSunday\n9:05A 9:40A\nK\nFRESNO TO\nOAKLAND\nFlight\n201\n225\n244\n201\n225\n244\n201\n535\nFare\nLeave Arrive Basis\nMonday thru Thursday\n7:00A\n8:02A\nS\n12:25P\n1:00P\n6:05P\n7:07P\nFriday\n7:00A\n12:25P\n6:05P\n7:00A\n3:00P\n8:02A\n1:00P\n7:07P\nSaturday\n8:02A\n4:02P\nS\nK\n203\n225\n244\n8:30A\n12:25P\n6:05P\nSunday\n9:27A\n1:00P\n7:07P\nFRESNO TO\nONTARIO\nFlight\n508\nFare\nLeave Arrive Basis\nMonday thru Thursday\n9:35A 10:20A\nS\n508\nFriday\n9:35A\n10:20A\nS\n522\n359/762\n508\nSaturday\n12:30P\n7:35P\n1:15P\n9:50P\nSunday\n9:35A 10:20A\nK\nFRESNO TO\nORANGE COUNTY\nFlight\n214\n224\n48\n214\n224\n48\n214\n48\n203/314\n224\n48\nFare\nLeave Arrive Basis\nMonday thru Thursday\n9:20A 10:05A\n2:20P\n5:20P\n3:05P\nS\n6:10P\nFriday\n9:20A\n10:05A\n2:20P\n3:05P\n5:20P\n6:10P\nSaturday\n9:20A\n10:05A\n5:20P\n6:10P\nS\nK\nSunday\n8:30A\n2:20P\n5:20P\n11:00A\n3:05P\n6:10P\nS-$21.00\nK-$16.00\nLAKE TAHOE TO\nFRESNO\nStops\nFlight\n48\n0\n48\n48\n48\nFare\nLeave Arrive Basis\nMonday thru Thursday\n4:30P\n5:05P\nS\nFriday\n4:30P\n5:05P\nS\nSaturday\n4:30P\n5:05P\nK\nSunday\n4:30